# Printventory Website

Marketing and download hub for [Printventory](https://github.com/TechJeeper/Printventory) — a free, open-source desktop (and Docker) app for managing local STL/3MF libraries.

**Live site:** [printventory.com](https://printventory.com/)

## What Printventory does

- Indexes STL, 3MF, STEP, OBJ, and more where they already live (nothing uploaded)
- Thumbnails, tags, designers, notes, source URLs, and folder-tree browsing
- Print lifecycle with real history (Want / Queued / Printing / Printed / Failed)
- Filament catalog with optional Spoolman sync
- Printer management (maintenance, reminders, network scan) and parts stock
- Instant search and filters across large libraries
- AI-assisted tagging (metadata only; model files stay local)
- Browser extension inbox, organize-library tools, and Docker/NAS server mode
- Windows, macOS, Linux, plus HTTPS/PWA for phones

